# Development Principles

Wishly currently follows this storage rule:

```text
Guest
  ↓
localStorage only

Logged-in Customer
  ↓
Wishly API
  ↓
App Database
```

The application database should remain the permanent source of truth for authenticated customer wishlists.

Guest wishlist operations should never accidentally modify a logged-in customer's permanent wishlist.

